# Teamdaten ↔ Helferliste UI alignment

When changing data-collection grids, treat **Helferliste** as the model unless noted.

## Decided

- **Page chrome**: Teamdaten uses `VolunteerStaffingFilterBar` (leading / middle / trailing); publish toolbar uses `vol-roster-toolbar--solo`.
- **Sorting**: Teamdaten sorts Nr, Teamname, Organisation (same `vol-sort` header UX as Helferliste).
- **Table cell editors / save rules**: Helferliste as model (text trim; shared field chrome in `volunteers.css`).
- **Search casing**: `toLowerCase()` like roster haystack; Teamdaten fields stay name/org/nr.
- **Shared CSS**: Sticky/detail/tristate field chrome lives in `volunteers.css`.
- **Popover busy**: Local `saving` around PATCH; buttons **Abbrechen** / **Übernehmen**.
- **Filter a11y**: All filter chips use `:aria-pressed`.
